    "https://www.lsuhsc.edu/shv/CareerOpportunities/Home/Detail/5554": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor Clinical - MC EA Conway",
      "description": "Assistant Professor Clinical | LSUHSC Shreveport Tuesday, October 13, 2026 Login / Register FAQ Contact Us Open Positions Assistant Professor Clinical Position Details Expiration Date Open Until Filled Department MC EA Conway Position Type Faculty Location Shreveport Description Duties will include providing/supervising obstetrical and gynecological services to patients in the OB/GYN Faculty Clinic and Labor & Delivery Unit with in-house call to be determined by the Department Chairman along with involvement in other outside institutional endeavors. Also included is teaching/educational obligations throughout your employment. Consideration will be extended to all candidates who meet the required qualifications. Special interest will be directed to candidates who meet or exceed the needs of the department. Maternal-Fetal Medicine (MFM) Specialists and Gynecologic Oncologists are encouraged to apply. Qualifications The applicant must meet the following: MD and/or DO Board certified/eligible in Obstetrics/Gynecology Licensed or eligible for licensure in the State of Louisiana A distinguished record in Obstetrics, Gynecology and Women's Health Outstanding surgical skills and commensurate clinical activities Candidates must have a firm commitment to the education of residents and medical students Additional Position Information PSN/PER Number: PSN 51850/PER 25-01-0050 Salary: Commensurate with Experience Primary Location: Monroe, LA (on-site position) About the School The LSU Systems Office has provided LSU Health-Shreveport employees with excellent benefit options designed with you and your dependents in mind. Our Benefits Section is available between 8:00 a.m. and 4:30 p.m., Monday through Friday, to help answer any questions you might have about these benefits. The salary is commensurate with experience and training. Generous Health, Dental, and Vision Insurance Life Insurance Long-Term Disability Insurance Accidental Death & Dismemberment Insura