    "https://www.lsuhsc.edu/shv/CareerOpportunities/Home/Detail/5596": {
      "title": "Assistant/Associate Professor Pediatrician-Monroe, Louisiana - MC Pediatrics",
      "description": "Assistant/Associate Professor Pediatrician-Monroe, Louisiana | LSUHSC Shreveport Tuesday, October 13, 2026 Login / Register FAQ Contact Us Open Positions Assistant/Associate Professor Pediatrician-Monroe, Louisiana Position Details Expiration Date Open Until Filled Department MC Pediatrics Position Type Faculty Location Shreveport Description The Department of Pediatrics at Louisiana State University Health Sciences Center in Shreveport is seeking a full-time BC/BE Pediatrician.  This position is based out of Ochsner LSU Health System Monroe Medical Center-Monroe, LA. Job Summary: Primary responsibilities include a Pediatric inpatient and outpatient practice with patient care, resident, and medical student education. We are looking for a physician to join our expanding primary care team and provide patients with high-quality treatment and diagnostic services. The ideal candidate is an intuitive healthcare professional whose diagnostic abilities are only matched by their concern for their patients. Academic rank and salary will be commensurate with qualifications and experience. Qualifications The applicant must meet the following: BC/BE Pediatrician Additional Position Information PSN/PER Number: PSN 28666/PER 23-10-9874 Salary Range: Negotiable/Commensurate with experience Primary Location: Monroe, LA About the School The LSU Systems Office has provided LSUHSC-Shreveport employees with excellent benefit options designed with you and your dependents in mind. Our Benefits Section is available between 8:00 a.m. and 4:30 p.m., Monday through Friday, to help answer any questions you might have about these benefits. LSUHSC – Shreveport is an equal opportunity employer and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Applicant Instructions Locate and click on the Apply Online b