    "https://www.lsuhsc.edu/shv/CareerOpportunities/Home/Detail/5846": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor - Clinical - MC Medicine Infectious Disease",
      "description": "Assistant Professor - Clinical | LSUHSC Shreveport Tuesday, October 13, 2026 Login / Register FAQ Contact Us Open Positions Assistant Professor - Clinical Position Details Expiration Date Open Until Filled Department MC Medicine Infectious Disease Position Type Faculty Location Shreveport Description The Department of Internal Medicine at Louisiana State University Health Sciences Center in Shreveport is seeking applicants for a full-time position in the Section of Infectious Disease. This position is for an Assistant Professor of Medicine in the Division of Infectious Diseases. Graduating ID fellows are welcome to apply. Areas of clinical and research interest include HIV medicine and literacy, transplant infections, antimicrobial stewardship, viral hepatitis, and algae infections. We are especially interested in qualiﬁed candidates who can contribute, through their research, teaching, and/or service, to the diversity and excellence of the academic community and will work toward building an equitable and diverse scholarly environment. Qualifications The applicant must meet the following: Have an M.D. Be eligible for medical licensure and clinical practice in the state of Louisiana. Board-Certified/Board Eligible in Internal Medicine. Provide evidence of experience. Additional Position Information PSN/PER Number: PSN 24744/PER 2988 Salary Range: $110,000 - $125,000 Primary Location: Shreveport, LA (On-Site) About the School The LSU Systems Office has provided LSU Health-Shreveport employees with excellent benefit options designed with you and your dependents in mind. Our Benefits Section is available between 8:00 a.m. and 4:30 p.m., Monday through Friday, to help answer any questions you might have about these benefits. Salary is commensurate with experience and training Generous Health, Dental, and Vision Insurance Life Insurance Long-Term Disability Insurance Accidental Death & Dismemberment Insurance Flexible Spending Account Optional Retire